<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81805" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιοπτέος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιοράω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be
				overlooked</i> or <i>suffered</i>, c. part., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔ σφι π. Ἑλλὰς ἀπολλυμένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.168
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμῖν τοῦτό ἐστι οὐ π., γένος τὸ
					Εὐρυσθένεος γενέσθαι ἐξίτηλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					5.39
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be watched</i> or <i>guarded against</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				8.48
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιοπτέον</span>
			<i>one must overlook</i> or <i>suffer</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Lac.</u>
				9.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Agath.
				3.10
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
